# Chrome on this computer uses the current host with port 8080 by default.
# The Android emulator uses http://10.0.2.2:8080 by default.
# On a physical Android device, use the computer's reachable LAN address instead
# (for example: http://192.168.1.20:8080), or configure an HTTPS backend.
# Copy this file to .env.local and set the URL when the default is not suitable.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.1.20:8080
